	(gr_text "FABRICATION NOTES (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED)\n\n1) 	OUTLINE DEFINED IN SEPARATE GERBER FILE WITH \n	{dblquote}Edge_Cuts.GBR{dblquote} SUFFIX. \n	DIMENSIONS OF CIRCUMSIZED RECTANGLE SHOWN \n	ON THIS DWG FOR REF ONLY.\n\n2) 	SEE SEPARATE DRILL FILES WITH {dblquote}.DRL{dblquote} SUFFIX FOR HOLE LOCATIONS.\n	SELECTED HOLE LOCATIONS SHOWN ON THIS DWG FOR REF ONLY.\n\n3)	IMPEDANCE CONTROL REQUIRED.\n	Microstrip 100-Ohm Differential (L1 ref. L2)\n	0.2032mm width, 0.28mm spacing\n\n4) 	CONFIRM TRACE WIDTHS AND SPACINGS.\n\n5)	DESIGN GEOMETRY MINIMUM FEATURE SIZES:\n	TRACE WIDTH			??? mm		\n	TRACE TO TRACE		??? mm\n	MIN. HOLE (PTH)		??? mm		\n	MIN. HOLE (NPTH)	??? mm\n	ANNULAR RING		??? mm		\n	COPPER TO HOLE		??? mm	\n	COPPER TO EDGE		??? mm		\n	HOLE TO HOLE		??? mm"
